tats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Graveyard_HappyBirthdayNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Graveyard_HappyBirthdayNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Graveyard_HappyBirthdayNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2d5ce8f7-c01d-4d05-acc3-b4fbb2463591</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2d5ce8f7-c01d-4d05-acc3-b4fbb2463591\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2d5ce8f7-c01d-4d05-acc3-b4fbb2463591\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Found on a grave in the <a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard_(Lower_City)\" title=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\">Graveyard</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;24&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;14</span>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My love,\n</p><p><br>\nYou would have been 47 today. We celebrated with cake and ale. We sang your song. We imagined you were there with us and what you'd say. Living without you doesn't hurt any less, but the pain's become less harrowing. I adore you.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202158\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1359/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23240/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5378/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935650/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.426      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.426      1 -total\n 50.77%   19.507      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.18%   17.359     15 Template:Trim\n 24.82%    9.538      2 Template:Uid\n 16.31%    6.269      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.58%    5.603      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.34%    3.975      1 Template:Notes\n  9.72%    3.734      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.68%    3.719      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46904-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202158 and revision id 243604. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}